  "recap": [
    "Boston led 33–21 after one and 66–54 at the half, then broke it open with a 39–21 third to go up 105–75. Pritchard scored 19 in that quarter alone. The defense set it up: 14 steals turned into 39 points off turnovers, and Chicago shot 12-of-44 from three. The bench poured in 79."
  ],
